{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_08",
  "title": "Gavial's Fist",
  "storyCode": "RI-8",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cc1926db06c5dbb359f4b3dfd3942267265f60fc57d3c5fb56dc68d37391873c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "text": "The buildings here are so different from the other tribes...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "text": "Crappy houses!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Hm, the architecture and decor is all pretty crude.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Got a lotta weird, broken gizmos all over the place too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Zumama, you've got a very unique tribe here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Looks like they enjoy fiddling around with machines just as much as you do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "This is my people's masterpiece.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Yes. They now know the charm of the machines, and they have built the tribe you see here on their passion alone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "text": "Look, it's Gavial!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "text": "The Great Chief wasn't lying. She's planning to duel Gavial again with the Big Ugly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
      "text": "What?! No way I can miss that!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceobe",
      "text": "Wow, there's so many people!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Many of them are from other tribes who've came here after the ceremony. They will be joining us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "So, what did you want to say?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Gavial, if you just left without a fuss, I wouldn't have cared. But since you're standing before me once again, I will defeat you right here and now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Because you're too strong, Gavial.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Do you still remember that day?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "That day?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Before that day, I was just like you. I believed the strength in my fists was everything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Hah!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Ahhhh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Archosauria",
      "text": "Gavial wins!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Haha, I win again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Hmph, another rematch! I'll definitely win this time!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Sure!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Eh, why is the ground shaking?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Look over there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Wh- what's that?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "It's a big hunk of metal!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Archosauria",
      "text": "That is a Sargon nomadic city...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "What's a Sargon?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Archosauria",
      "text": "Sargon is our country.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Then what's a nomadic city?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Archosauria",
      "text": "A nomadic city is a very large tribe, with many people living in it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Archosauria",
      "text": "I visited once, when I was young.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Archosauria",
      "text": "Don't be afraid. It won't come over here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Old Archosauria",
      "text": "It will never have anything to do with us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Zumama, what is it? Are you feeling sick?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "No. I'm going home.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Oh, I remember. A Sargon nomadic city was passing pretty close to us that day. You turned all weird after that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "I think you're the weird one, Gavial.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "How could you not feel astonished after seeing something like that? How could you not be shocked? How could you not feel like a tiny speck of dust?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "I mean, I guess I felt something like 'Wow, that's big.' But what's a big thing got to do with me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "That's our Gavial.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "But that's the day I lost interest in fighting with you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "I asked Inam to help me find books on machinery, and began studying Sargonian and mechanical engineering.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Then I met the High Priest, and we began building the Big, Ugly Thing together.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "I know. I did go to look for you after all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Hm? Does that mean that the weirdo over there is your invisible friend?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "That's right!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Woah! When did you get here?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "This feller's got the same energy as my Baws, the Emperor...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Emperor? Are you talking about that penguin?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Sure am. Hold on a minute, you know the Baws?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Of course, of course I do. Though it's been a couple of decades since we last met... Eh, was it a few decades? Or a few centuries? Doesn't matter. I can smell him on you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "What's that about a few centuries...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Lordy loo! Who'da thunk I'd meet a friend of the Baws out here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "So you really do exist. I always thought Zumama got messed up in the head and hallucinated you. I was even researching similar cases at Rhodes Island.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Oh, don't you know, Gavial? Whenever you came to look for Zumama, I was always there watching!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Just like this!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "He disappeared!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Hahaha, I wouldn't normally show myself to you, but since I want to pilot the Big Ugly, I have no choice!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Building machines with the little ones is actually a lot of fun!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Speaking of the Big Ugly, shouldn't somebody be driving it? 'cause I'm pretty sure it's about to crash into that house.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Huh? Oh, crap! Gotta go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Wow, he popped back into that thing quick. Badass.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "He'n the Boss really are birds of a feather, huh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Oh, right, our conversation. Zumama, let's get to the point, if we're gonna fight anyway do we really have to talk about all this stuff?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "I have things to say to you, and to myself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Did you know, Gavial? You were always my biggest obstacle.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Huh? Really?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Well, not just you, but people like you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "I've tried so many times to teach people about the charm of the machines. But in the end, they're never interested.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Because they look up to strong people, like you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "You teach them that, in this place, you get what you want when you're strong.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "It's your strength that stands in the way of progress.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "So I decided to change the way they think. I'm going to use an even greater power to destroy this blind worship of strength that you created.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Well, that makes sense to me. What do you think, Doctor?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Indeed.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Doctor, whose side are you on?!",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Croissant",
              "text": "Sounds like yer talkin' sense, but it still don't feel right, somehow...",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Machines are cool.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "text": "Hell yeah! That big clanker's badass!",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Honestly, I'm almost convinced myself.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "But I never wanted to be anyone's role model. When I say fists solve problems, that's just me talking. It's got nothing to do with anyone else.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "I know, I'm not blaming you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Even so, Gavial, I want to defeat you with the power of the Big Ugly.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Everyone, listen up!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "The Big Ugly will be dueling Gavial once again!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "This battle will decide who is the real Great Chief!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "High Priest, it's time to fight!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "You got it!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Are you ready, Gavial? Your friends can join the fight too!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Finally!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Step back, everybody. This one's mine.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Come at me!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Let's test its performance first!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Fire!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Heh, don't think you'll hit me a second time!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Ah, those are the reflexes I'd expect from Gavial! No problem. Have a taste of my great iron fist!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "A test of strength, huh? Sounds good to me!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceobe",
          "text": "Wow, Gavial's strong!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Croissant",
          "text": "Crazy strong! She stopped its fist all by lonesome!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "I know I asked way back when I got my first physical, but why is she a medic again?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "...You may be my opponent, but I can't help but cheer for you!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "It's not over yet though! The Big Ugly has a max performance mode for just such an occasion!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Go!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "What?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "That big guy looks stronger!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "And it's suppressing Gavial's strength?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Oh, what a melodious sound...! Hm? Wait, these readings are strange... Whaaa?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "High Priest, what's going on?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Waah, my butt's being cooked!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "I'm talking about the Big Ugly!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Oh, I was just sharing my status as well. I think the engine output is too high. I'm losing control of the Big Ugly!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "It's actually quite exhilarating!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "Get out of there!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Aren't we fighting? Let's just fight like this! Come, Gavial, I'll finish this once and for all——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "High Priest!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Oh, fine. What a shame. Looks like I'll have to change tactics.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "High Priest",
          "text": "Zumama, don't worry about me, I'll do my best to stabilize it. You find a way to stop the Big Ugly in the meantime!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "text": "...Gavial, you and your people get out of here. This isn't your business.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
